# Presence privacy

The microphone and the camera start off. `retainMedia` stays false.

- Show a visible indicator whenever either device is live.
- Camera gaze is optional and must have a control that turns it fully off.
- Camera samples stay in memory for one frame. Do not record, upload, or infer an emotion from them.
- If speech recognition or synthesis is missing, say so. Do not invent a transcript or spoken audio.

```ts
const privacy = defaultPrivacy();
if (privacy.cameraGaze || privacy.retainMedia) throw new Error('privacy_default');
```

Do not open a capture device from the television home or from a test.
